config VIDEO_BF30A2
	tristate "BF30A2 and BF3A01 camera sensors"
	depends on I2C && VIDEO_DEV && PM
	select V4L2_FWNODE
	help
	  Enable support for the BF30A2 and BF3A01 240x320 YUV422 sensors.
	  The device is controlled over I2C and exposes a V4L2 subdevice
	  for capture controllers. The sensor clock and supplies must be
	  described by the board's device tree.
